1. PURPOSE OF THIS LICENSE
===============================================================================

This repository is made publicly available for academic, educational, research,
review, and thesis-related purposes only.

The intention of this license is to allow students, researchers, instructors,
reviewers, and non-commercial academic users to read, study, reproduce, modify,
test, validate, and reference the work, while strictly prohibiting any commercial
use without the prior explicit written permission of the Licensor.

This repository is source-available for academic and non-commercial purposes.
It is not released as open-source software under an OSI-approved license, because
commercial use and certain fields of use are restricted.

